WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
[Low strings and drums] Clack breaks a copper seam with a pickaxe.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Clack draws a bow and shoots at a monster in Cinderbell.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[Music builds] Tidehex magic strikes a group of monsters in Riptide Vault.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Clack swings a sword in the final round of the Pearl Ring.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
[Music swells] Ring Champion. The crowd throws gold into the ring.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Clack. Forge your way through Siltwick.
